      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-11-15T19:25:42.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Scenario 1: &nbsp;The assimilation is not unlimited, that is a mistake that is easy to make and deadly, Omnitron can't flip multiple markers in a turn.</p><p>It is a hard mission, the key is to get to Omni and Incap him as fast as you can, remove either the card that gives him 3 powers or his plating. &nbsp;He is far less dangerous with only 2 actions a turn.</p><p>I've never had too unbalanced a time with Omni's scenarios, can you tell us how Omni won, what he was doing that crushed the heroes?</p>",
